          "type": "online_environment",
          "definition": "Each action is $x_t\\in[0,1]$, with fixed initial history $x_{1-m:0}=0$. Memory length $m\\ge2$ includes the current action; two previous actions plus the current one correspond to $m=3$. $$f_t:[0,1]^m\\to\\mathbb R\\ \\text{is convex quadratic},\\qquad |f_t(z)|\\le B,\\qquad\\|\\nabla f_t(z)\\|_2\\le L\\quad(\\forall z\\in[0,1]^m).$$ The coefficients of $f_t$ may depend on history through $t-m$, but not more recent actions."
